                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "costed"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Captain's had a letter. Held, it says.\" The watchman yawns. \"Held's a good word. I'd like my shift held. With me not in it.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "minuted"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Written down downriver. That's their half of the work.\" He shifts his weight. \"Our half's standing here.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "subscribed"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Part-owner, the captain says.\" He looks at you blearily. \"Of us as well, I expect. Don't ask me for a longer shift.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "walked"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Walked out halfway, I heard. Lucky.\" He shifts his weight. \"Half a shift left, me.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "text": "Half a shift left. Then bread, and a chair, and nobody talking to me.",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
